{
  "id": "569",
  "title": "Bad Luck Fracture",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-09-23",
  "synopsis": "A patient at the hospital explains how he suffered a fracture through bad luck.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/841/bace953cc094277cae3f7137ad16004488ec1124.mp3?1536666379",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "倒霉\n\n    医院里来了一个骨折的病人，医生问病人是怎么骨折的？\n    病人说：“我太倒霉了！今天，我觉得鞋里有沙子，就扶着电线杆抖鞋子。有个人经过，他以为我触电了，拿起旁边的棍子，给了我两棍。所以我就骨折了”",
    "traditional": "倒霉\n\n    醫院裡來了一個骨折的病人，醫生問病人是怎麼骨折的？\n    病人說：“我太倒霉了！今天，我覺得鞋裡有沙子，就扶著電線杆抖鞋子。有個人經過，他以為我觸電了，拿起旁邊的棍子，給了我兩棍。所以我就骨折了”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Bad Luck"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "医院里来了一个骨折的病人，医生问病人是怎么骨折的？",
      "traditional": "醫院裡來了一個骨折的病人，醫生問病人是怎麼骨折的？",
      "pinyin": "yī yuàn lǐ lái le yí ge gǔ zhé de bìng rén yī shēng wèn bìng rén shì zěn me gǔ zhé de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A patient with a fracture arrived at the hospital. The doctor asked the patient how he had suffered the fracture."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "病人说：“我太倒霉了！",
      "traditional": "病人說：“我太倒霉了！",
      "pinyin": "bìng rén shuō wǒ tài dǎo méi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "今天，我觉得鞋里有沙子，就扶着电线杆抖鞋子。",
      "traditional": "今天，我覺得鞋裡有沙子，就扶著電線杆抖鞋子。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ jué de xié lǐ yǒu shā zi jiù fú zhe diàn xiàn gān dǒu xié zi",
      "english": "The patient said: “I had such bad luck!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "有个人经过，他以为我触电了，",
      "traditional": "有個人經過，他以為我觸電了，",
      "pinyin": "yǒu ge rén jīng guò tā yǐ wéi wǒ chù diàn le",
      "english": "“Today, I felt that I had some sand in my shoe, so I leaned against a power pole and shook my shoe.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "拿起旁边的棍子，给了我两棍。所以我就骨折了”",
      "traditional": "拿起旁邊的棍子，給了我兩棍。所以我就骨折了”",
      "pinyin": "ná qǐ páng biān de gùn zi gěi le wǒ liǎng gùn suǒ yǐ wǒ jiù gǔ zhé le",
      "english": "“A person passed by, and thought I was getting an electric shock.”"
    }
  ],
