      "Bad Luck",
      "",
      "A patient with a fracture arrived at the hospital. The doctor asked the patient how he had suffered the fracture.",
      "",
      "The patient said: “I had such bad luck!”",
      "“Today, I felt that I had some sand in my shoe, so I leaned against a power pole and shook my shoe.”",
      "“A person passed by, and thought I was getting an electric shock.”",
      "“He picked up a stick lying by the side, and hit me twice. So then my bone broke.”"
